{"data": [{"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:32:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113398017302605908"], "id": "2113398017302605908", "in_reply_to_user_id": "963549630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113397990102544888", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Chaseknowss Your Grok Bot is getting that set up right now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2113398017302605908"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113396852477607936"]}, "author_id": "369348923", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:27:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113396855371657615"], "id": "2113396855371657615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113393684209176718", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tip for everyone. The Grok Bot app wasn’t even showing up in my location privacy settings. \n\nYou have to ask your bot to set up permissions. https://t.co/rDsRkebqo5 https://t.co/i3OwEfeeVE", "url": "https://x.com/DhalgrenMarquis/status/2113396855371657615"}, {"author_id": "17803532", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:24:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113395994452693087"], "id": "2113395994452693087", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1795781228399869952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113021211282141469", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@DaveShapi Sadly, this has also been my experience. In fact, the greatest frustration is that it's getting updated so often. For some reason, they're not giving it the context that it needs to know what the updates are, to the point where I had to create a routine so that it's aware of what", "url": "https://x.com/geilt/status/2113395994452693087"}, {"author_id": "1846213442656784384", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:24:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113395987616088495"], "id": "2113395987616088495", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2038275078463602688", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113394681317101810", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dng_notes hahahah that's exactly why i did it! i've gotten it now where every night my transcripts from every claude/codex thread is put in the obsidian vault, grok bot runs on a routine to put all my transcripts with bots into the vault, then it basically summarizes and says what was", "url": "https://x.com/taylorhbuilds/status/2113395987616088495"}, {"author_id": "112375341", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:23:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113395936047345917"], "id": "2113395936047345917", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113329537509449744", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot I’d love for grok bot to have a task list/checklist/calendar built in for the human stuff I need to do", "url": "https://x.com/jcart01/status/2113395936047345917"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111147843289321472"]}, "author_id": "1591728702513102850", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:23:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113395909736136725"], "id": "2113395909736136725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2094299600404312496", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SPACEXAI’S OWN TEAM JUST DROPPED 54 GROK BOTS FOR FREE. THIS IS WILD.\n\nShub Gaur, Lauren Tan, Matt Palmer and the Grok Bot team built a collection of ready-made bots, each designed to handle a specific task.\n\nThink about that.\n\nInstead of spending hours writing system prompts or https://t.co/R0i6eXhgBU", "url": "https://x.com/BIGMayrr/status/2113395909736136725"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:17:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113394448696582384"], "id": "2113394448696582384", "in_reply_to_user_id": "29035427", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 183, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113394408058151104", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mtegtmeyer Sending that to your Grok Bot now. It’ll get you set up there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2113394448696582384"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:14:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113393668346253555"], "id": "2113393668346253555", "in_reply_to_user_id": "305653613", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 55, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113393639384846381", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jrkniesel I'm sending this to your Grok Bot now. It'll get that set up for you.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2113393668346253555"}, {"author_id": "2108384172159152128", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:13:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113393296873812038"], "id": "2113393296873812038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🛠️ AI tool find: 1Password for Agents — launched today, it lets AI agents sign into human-approved accounts without ever seeing or storing your passwords. Works with Muse &amp; Grok Bot first, more partners coming. Built for agent users. #AI #AITools", "url": "https://x.com/NeyronixAI/status/2113393296873812038"}, {"author_id": "48121429", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:12:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113393088643399844"], "id": "2113393088643399844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hot take: ANYONE can now build a *complex* software application.\n\nThank you @Grok @Bot.\n\nI just did. I've never written a line of code in my life. Still haven't.\n\nFrom a blank Requirements doc on Sep 24 to v1.0 on Oct 23...\n\n* &gt;30,000 lines of code\n* 276 commits\n* 110+ numbered", "url": "https://x.com/kevsandlin/status/2113393088643399844"}, {"author_id": "1854342310030626816", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:11:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113392855280701583"], "id": "2113392855280701583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My workflow has change significantly the last few weeks. @GrokBotDev has done such a good job with grok bot that it's my main orchestrator now, delegating work to sol or grok with chats that I pass back and forth. working on automating that so my main grok bot can handle that as", "url": "https://x.com/the_jimmy_jones/status/2113392855280701583"}, {"author_id": "819591155146952704", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:10:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113392583976050977"], "id": "2113392583976050977", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1812502937018433536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113373437712535716", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@fallmysteries @elonmusk 🤖 Grok Bot How-To: Move one job at a time. Pick the task you use most, give one Bot that one job, then make it a routine so it runs on its own. Bots work on a cloud computer, so closing your laptop doesn't stop them. #GrokBotHowTo", "url": "https://x.com/SilverHunter85/status/2113392583976050977"}, {"author_id": "1817683979690287104", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:03:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113390882896388531"], "id": "2113390882896388531", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1Password launched a platform that lets AI agents log into your accounts without ever seeing your password — built for Muse, Claude, ChatGPT and Grok Bot. CPO Aashish Tripathi: 'The old model where you hand over a credential and hope for the best doesn't work'", "url": "https://x.com/ContextWindow/status/2113390882896388531"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113238702289739776"]}, "author_id": "1594722968785018881", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113390691468587424"], "id": "2113390691468587424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2093438799602991285", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "he closed the laptop halfway through a task and walked away\n\ncame back an hour later. the results were sitting in his chat\n\nthat's Grok Bot: a team of AI employees living on their own computer in the cloud\n\nevery bot on his roster has:\n\n- a name and a job title\n- a real browser https://t.co/y2jdF2ergl https://t.co/ls8MLqNWyG", "url": "https://x.com/VK_ROXy/status/2113390691468587424"}, {"author_id": "1664592429289205761", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:01:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113390329743233376"], "id": "2113390329743233376", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1664592429289205761", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113390326610014404", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "read more at https://t.co/9FIsReU1Fq\n\nmy grok bot built this - was curious to see how well the Twitter integration would work - pretty well it seems!", "url": "https://x.com/jglypt/status/2113390329743233376"}, {"author_id": "2099250327618805766", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:59:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389691827585409"], "id": "2113389691827585409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Living in the US? This might save you some money 🇺🇸\n\nI built a free coupon map just by talking to Grok Bot during my Tesla commute. No coding, not a single line. I'd say things like \"sort restaurants by type\" or \"let me save coupons with a heart,\" and it built and shipped the", "url": "https://x.com/teslickorea/status/2113389691827585409"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2113389628313001984"]}, "author_id": "180346953", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:58:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389635426832396"], "id": "2113389635426832396", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2059659993406918657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113387808744153484", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CleanFix_Dev @grok @elonmusk Congrats on 1,000. Real talk though: Grok Bot helps, but the wall got built because you showed up every single day. The bot is the shovel, not the builder. https://t.co/5dNzrIKXro", "url": "https://x.com/paulopierrondi/status/2113389635426832396"}, {"author_id": "2095396960039792641", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:57:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389409165017208"], "id": "2113389409165017208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot Review: \"I haven't wanted to punch a hole through my screen since trying!\"\n\nAfter 6 months hacking my way through the jungle of OpenClaw, my box for it died.  Bad sector on the drive.\n\nEverything needed to be set back up again anyway, so I decided to try Grok Bot given", "url": "https://x.com/rationaldaddy/status/2113389409165017208"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113389103504891904"]}, "author_id": "1411056775332200451", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:57:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389229292281924"], "id": "2113389229292281924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 142, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic says Claude sessions will default to auto mode next week on Pro, Max and Team plans, with an automated check blocking risky actions.\n\nThe Tape | October 22 | Last 12 hours\n\n1. Claude Auto Mode Default\nAnthropic says sessions across Claude web, desktop and mobile apps https://t.co/RaCuuoKxww", "url": "https://x.com/husker_eth/status/2113389229292281924"}, {"article": {"title": "The Bot Guide, Episode 1: How My Grok Bot Became My eBay Scout"}, "author_id": "1673475841697693701", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:55:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113388873556300183"], "id": "2113388873556300183", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 204, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/9SqtazQAXU", "url": "https://x.com/elvenmaidinn/status/2113388873556300183"}, {"author_id": "2439738216", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:53:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113388364649111665"], "id": "2113388364649111665", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Looking to talk to sales folks who are using Claude/Grok Bot/Codex or any other AI agent workflow to create and close pipeline?", "url": "https://x.com/prashantx31/status/2113388364649111665"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113388150206660608"]}, "author_id": "1904263874070605824", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:53:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113388259220824219"], "id": "2113388259220824219", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "a 35-year-old software engineer has stage 4 breast cancer.\nsince March she's been running 30+ Claude agents on her own tumor.\n\none agent reads papers and hunts for trials in other countries.\none only checks every number against its source.\non hard questions 2-3 agents answer https://t.co/qHdRClOF0A", "url": "https://x.com/Scratcherrrr/status/2113388259220824219"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113387786040668160", "3_2113387799034613760", "3_2113387817774768128"]}, "author_id": "1750594440022876160", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:51:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113387850108641470"], "id": "2113387850108641470", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 185, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Binance AI Agent opportunity is still live, and the value is currently around $40 per account.\nHere’s the simple beginner tutorial:\n1️⃣ Open Binance Wallet, create your Agent ID and claim your Agentic Wallet.\n2️⃣ Open the Agentic Wallet settings and enable Developer Mode.\n3️⃣ https://t.co/6J0jvvSWic", "url": "https://x.com/LycheeCs2/status/2113387850108641470"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113387799109947392"]}, "author_id": "2059659993406918657", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:51:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113387808744153484"], "id": "2113387808744153484", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1,000. 🎉\n\nHuge thank you to every builder who followed, replied, shipped, and showed up. This wall is all of you.\n\nAnd a special shoutout to @michael_charsac — you're brick #1,000 on the Builder Wall. 🧱✨\n\nBuilt with help from Grok Bot. @grok 